On offer
    Say "<selfname>, as a token of my gratitude for your help last time, here's a special medicine I developed. It's a special gift just for you."
    Topic "Tell me more..." do
        Show quest "It's called antifebrile and Apple of Moradon is the main ingredient. How about it? Can you get some for me?\n\nI learned a different potion production method, and I need Apple of Moradon this time. If you bring me 5 Apple of Moradon, I think I can make antifebrile. Will you help me?"

